  "details": "When buying things on VRC Mobile (android) the currency isn't correctly converted meaning you pay more than shown.\n\nSo when paying on pc, I pay less as it properly converts the cost, however on mobile I'm paying more for the same item because of conversion rates not properly converting and being falsely advertised/show in ingame prices.\n\nThe example is shown below of a single gift drop shown as $9.99, however having to pay $12.71 because of conversion rates being not accounted for and being charged in my native currency at almost the same price.\n\nIf this is on purpose, this should be CLEAR and show in your native currency, instead of deceiving the price and only showing it in a quick single click checkout.",
